{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38010","headline":"即目二首 二 · 韩偓","name":"即目二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"动非求进静非禅，咋舌吞声过十年。\n溪涨浪花如积石，雨晴云叶似连钱。\n干戈岁久谙戎事，枕簟秋凉减夜眠。\n攻苦惯来无不可，寸心如水但澄鲜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38010.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38010","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}